%%label II. Allegro
%%note A quickstep march in C; a fiddle tune breaks in in another key while the march’s bass goes on; then both, with the hymn in the trombones, until it all stops short.
X:1
T:Ives’s Missing Symphony
T:II. Allegro
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of Charles Ives
M:2/4
L:1/8
Q:"Allegro" 1/4=120
%%score [fl ob cl bn] [hn tpt tbn] timp bells [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:fl clef=treble name="Fl. I, II"
V:ob clef=treble name="Ob. I, II"
